# SDK version sync

`sdk_version` in hello/receipt bodies is a **static** string. Do not read `pubspec.yaml` at build time or generate version files.

When the package version changes (release, bump, or `pubspec.yaml` `version:` edit), update **all** of these to the same value in the same change:

1. `pubspec.yaml` → `version`
2. `android/src/main/kotlin/com/pusher/sdk/PusherConfig.kt` → `SDK_VERSION`
3. `ios/pusher/Sources/pusher/PusherConfig.swift` → `sdkVersion`
4. `ios/pusher.podspec` → `s.version`
5. `android/build.gradle.kts` → `version`

Do not leave any of these stale. Do not reintroduce Gradle/podspec pubspec parsing for version.
